@startuml
skinparam monochrome true
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false
autonumber

actor "Data Engineer" as Engineer
participant ":System" as System
participant "Latitude/Longitude\nBST/AVL Indices" as Indexes
participant "KD-Tree Builder" as Builder
participant "Validation Log" as Log

== Bulk KD-Tree Build ==

activate Engineer
Engineer -> System : request bulk 2D KD-Tree build (stations.csv)
activate System

System -> System : validate station record fields
alt Invalid record
    System -> Log : write validation error (invalid lat/lon or name)
    Log --> System : logged
else Valid record
    System -> Indexes : insert into\nLatitude & Longitude AVL indices (USEI01)
    activate Indexes
    Indexes --> System : insertion ok
    deactivate Indexes
end

System -> Builder : start bulk balanced KD-Tree build\n(using AVL indices)
activate Builder

Builder -> Builder : select median by alternating dimension\n(lat ↔ lon)
Builder -> Builder : group duplicates (same lat/lon)\nsort by name ASC
Builder --> System : KD-Tree constructed with size, height, bucket stats
deactivate Builder

System --> Engineer : return KD-Tree build summary\n(size, height, distinct bucket sizes)
deactivate System

== Spatial Queries ==

Engineer -> System : perform range or nearest-neighbour query (lat, lon)
activate System
System -> Builder : query KD-Tree for matches
activate Builder
Builder --> System : return matching stations (deterministic order)
deactivate Builder
System --> Engineer : display query results
deactivate System
deactivate Engineer

@enduml
